                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W9105100                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  PROGRAMMET LÄSER FIL W01174 OCH GÖR MERGE MOT W91054  *        
*                OCH SKRIVER FIL W91051 MED ARTIKEL-BENÄMNING TILL VR  *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  BERT ANDERSSON                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W91051D1 FB(224  0)                                                        
%W91054  'IN1-'                                                                 
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W91051D2 FB(1447  0)                                                       
%W01171  'IN2-'                                                                 
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W91051D3 FB(108  0)                                                        
%W91051  'UT-'                                                                  
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    WORKING STORAGE                             *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                                                                               
  JA                        W   1 A   VALUE 'J'                                 
  NEJ                       W   1 A   VALUE 'N'                                 
  WS-IDDC                   W   2 A                                             
*                                                                               
  SPACE                     W   3 A   VALUE '   '                               
*                                                                               
  CZ                        W   3 A   VALUE 'CZ '                               
  GREECE                    W   3 A   VALUE 'GR '                               
  H                         W   3 A   VALUE 'H  '                               
  IR                        W   3 A   VALUE 'IR '                               
  J                         W   3 A   VALUE 'J  '                               
  KOR                       W   3 A   VALUE 'KOR'                               
  PL                        W   3 A   VALUE 'PL '                               
  RC                        W   3 A   VALUE 'RC '                               
  RCN                       W   3 A   VALUE 'RCN'                               
  RO                        W   3 A   VALUE 'RO '                               
  RUS                       W   3 A   VALUE 'RUS'                               
  T                         W   3 A   VALUE 'T  '                               
  TR                        W   3 A   VALUE 'TR '                               
  YU                        W   3 A   VALUE 'YU '                               
*                                                                               
  SPRAK-IX                  W  2 N  VALUE 0                                     
  W91054D1-IX               W  9 N  VALUE 0                                     
  W01171D2-IX               W  9 N  VALUE 0                                     
  MATCH-IX                  W  9 N  VALUE 0                                     
  OMATCH-IX                 W  9 N  VALUE 0                                     
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    JOB SECTION                                 *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                                                                               
*******************************************                                     
* MATCHAR W91054 OCH W01171                                                     
*******************************************                                     
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W91051D1 KEY (IN1-IDARTNR) +                                         
           W91051D2 KEY (IN2-IDARTNR)) +                                        
                          START A-INIT +                                        
                          FINISH Z-FINIT                                        
                                                                                
     IF MATCHED                                                                 
                                                                                
       UT-IDARTNR   = IN2-IDARTNR                                               
       SPRAK-IX = 1                                                             
       DO WHILE SPRAK-IX LT 15                                                  
         UT-IDSKYLT   = ' '                                                     
         UT-BEART     = ' '                                                     
         UT-IDSKYLT   = IN2-IDSKYLT(SPRAK-IX)                                   
         UT-BEART     = IN2-BEARTEXT (SPRAK-IX)                                 
         PERFORM S01-WRITE-UTFIL                                                
         SPRAK-IX = SPRAK-IX + 1                                                
       END-DO                                                                   
       MATCH-IX = MATCH-IX + 1                                                  
                                                                                
     ELSE                                                                       
       OMATCH-IX = OMATCH-IX + 1                                                
       IF W91051D2                                                              
                                                                                
           W01171D2-IX = W01171D2-IX + 1                                        
                                                                                
       ELSE                                                                     
           W91054D1-IX = W91054D1-IX + 1                                        
       END-IF                                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
  S01-WRITE-UTFIL. PROC                                                         
                                                                                
     PUT W91051D3                                                               
     UT-BEART         = SPACE                                                   
  END-PROC                                                                      
                                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
***                                                                             
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
* A-INIT                                                 *                      
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
*                                                                               
 A-INIT.  PROC                                                                  
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
 DISPLAY ' A-INIT START:::'                                                     
                                                                                
       UT-IDARTNR     = 0                                                       
       UT-IDSKYLT     = SPACE                                                   
       UT-BEART       = SPACE                                                   
       SPRAK-IX       = 0                                                       
       W91054D1-IX    = 0                                                       
       W01171D2-IX    = 0                                                       
       MATCH-IX       = 0                                                       
       OMATCH-IX       = 0                                                      
                                                                                
                                                                                
 END-PROC                                                                       
*                                                                               
***                                                                             
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
* Z-FINIT                                                *                      
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
*                                                                               
 Z-FINIT.  PROC                                                                 
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
      DISPLAY 'W91054D1-IX ='  W91054D1-IX                                      
      DISPLAY 'W01171D2-IX ='  W01171D2-IX                                      
      DISPLAY 'MATCH-IX    ='  MATCH-IX                                         
      DISPLAY 'OMATCH-IX    =' OMATCH-IX                                        
                                                                                
*                                                                               
 END-PROC                                                                       
*                                                                               
***                                                                             
                                                                                
